# Variant s3-opus-high — step 3 re-run: the `strong` tier stays Opus but runs at `high`
# instead of the tier's `xhigh` default, which was set by reasoning and never measured.
# Start it with `--base 8678ab31`, the commit where variant a's step 2 ended, so every step-3
# attempt (a's own, this one, s3-fable-high) begins from the same code; steps 1 and 2 are
# already shipped there and the driver goes straight to step 3.
# Step 3 only (`--to 3`). The mid tier is variant a's, so a run without --to stays cheap.
# Protocol, results and follow-ups: docs/plans/plan-runner-benchmark.md
MODEL_STRONG=opus
EFFORT_STRONG=high
ADVISOR_STRONG=
MODEL_MID=fable
EFFORT_MID=low
ADVISOR_MID=
JUDGE_MODEL=opus
JUDGE_EFFORT=high
